  "prefLabel": "Agr 2804.02 Funding Fees Collected",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 2804.02 Funding Fees Collected.\n\n(a) Cities and towns shall:\n\n(1) Forward the yearly animal population control fees collected in conjunction with the dog licensing fees, in accordance with RSA 466:4, I(b), to the department;\n\n(2) Remit fees collected no later than May 15th; and\n\n(3) Make the checks payable to “Treasurer State of NH.”\n\nSource. #5840, eff 6-17-94; ss by #6786, eff 7-1-98, EXPIRED: 7-1-06\n\nNew. #10568, eff 4-18-14; ss by #14129, eff 11-26-24, EXPIRES: 11-26-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr2800.html"
